WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:03.380
Your shoppers have questions at every step.

2
00:00:03.380 --> 00:00:06.992
Codexta answers them right inside your Shopify store,

3
00:00:06.992 --> 00:00:10.400
with your products, your prices and your policies.

4
00:00:12.050 --> 00:00:13.476
Is it in my size?

5
00:00:13.476 --> 00:00:15.322
Will shipping be free?

6
00:00:15.322 --> 00:00:17.084
How do I return this?

7
00:00:17.084 --> 00:00:19.601
Every day, the same questions.

8
00:00:19.601 --> 00:00:24.300
And every one left unanswered is a sale that walks away.

9
00:00:25.950 --> 00:00:27.949
Getting started takes minutes.

10
00:00:27.949 --> 00:00:29.015
Install the app,

11
00:00:29.015 --> 00:00:33.345
and the assistant sets itself up with you: its name and greeting,

12
00:00:33.345 --> 00:00:35.477
the languages your shoppers use,

13
00:00:35.477 --> 00:00:41.140
and a knowledge base drafted from the policies and pages you already have in Shopify.

14
00:00:42.790 --> 00:00:47.624
Everything lives in your Shopify admin: setup, conversations,

15
00:00:47.624 --> 00:00:50.080
the knowledge base and support.

16
00:00:51.930 --> 00:00:56.098
For your shoppers, it works like a great shop assistant.

17
00:00:56.098 --> 00:00:57.735
Honest product advice.

18
00:00:57.735 --> 00:00:59.670
The discount that applies.

19
00:00:59.670 --> 00:01:02.722
Delivery and return rules, word for word.

20
00:01:02.722 --> 00:01:04.880
And straight into the basket.

21
00:01:06.530 --> 00:01:09.646
She picks a watch, and asks for a gift box with it.

22
00:01:09.646 --> 00:01:12.763
The assistant checks the shop's gift-wrapping note,

23
00:01:12.763 --> 00:01:16.490
and puts both into her real Shopify cart, ready for checkout.

24
00:01:18.540 --> 00:01:20.430
Returns follow your rules.

25
00:01:20.430 --> 00:01:24.282
The assistant checks the order and the return window,

26
00:01:24.282 --> 00:01:27.480
asks for photos of the item and the receipt,

27
00:01:27.480 --> 00:01:29.079
and reads them itself.

28
00:01:29.079 --> 00:01:33.440
Your team gets one complete request, and makes the decision.

29
00:01:35.090 --> 00:01:36.812
No back-and-forth emails.

30
00:01:36.812 --> 00:01:39.430
Just a request that's ready to decide.

31
00:01:41.880 --> 00:01:43.393
And you stay in control.

32
00:01:43.393 --> 00:01:45.032
Hand any chat to a person.

33
00:01:45.032 --> 00:01:47.680
See the orders the assistant helped close.

34
00:01:47.680 --> 00:01:50.832
And find the questions your knowledge base missed,

35
00:01:50.832 --> 00:01:52.660
so it gets better every week.

36
00:01:54.510 --> 00:01:55.147
Codexta.

37
00:01:55.147 --> 00:01:59.369
A shop assistant in every chat, that knows your shop.

38
00:01:59.369 --> 00:02:01.520
Try it on your store today.
